<title>UK: Britain's United Gas MD to leave in April.</title>
<headline>Britain's United Gas MD to leave in April.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Roger Turner, co-founder and managing director of gas supplier United Gas, a unit of UtiliCorp UK, will be leaving in April, a company statement said on Thursday.</p>
<p>UtiliCorp UK is the wholly-owned UK operation of Utilicorp United Inc, based in Kansas City, Missouri. It acquired full control of United Gas 12 months ago.</p>
<p>Turner will be continuing in an &quot;advisory role&quot; for the company, Chuck Dempster, chairman and CEO of UtiliCorp UK, said in statement.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom, +44 171 542 6412</p>
